* Coto 9012-12-10 FUNCTIONAL approximation; NOT a manufacturer SPICE model.
* Contact/static values from Classic-9011-9012-9117 datasheet, rev 05072024.
* Logic/driver assumed ideal; 0/12 V coil commands only, nominal 25 C.
* Coil inductance, flyback clamp, exact pickup/dropout, bounce and protection omitted.
* Operate time 0.35 ms includes bounce; release time 0.1 ms is a maximum.
* Contact-to-coil 1.4 pF split equally between two terminals to CP is an assumption.
.subckt COTO9012_FUNCTIONAL P N CP CN
+ params: RCONTACT=0.12 ROPEN=1e12 COPEN=0.7p CCOIL=1.4p
+ RCOIL=750 T_ON=350u T_OFF=100u
RCOIL CP CN {RCOIL}
BRAW RAW CN V=if(V(CP,CN)>6,1,0)
BEN ENABLE CN V=min(delay(V(RAW,CN),T_ON),delay(V(RAW,CN),T_OFF))
SREED P N ENABLE CN CONTACT
.model CONTACT SW(Ron={RCONTACT} Roff={ROPEN} Vt=0.5 Vh=0)
CCONTACT P N {COPEN}
CPAR_P P CP {CCOIL/2}
CPAR_N N CP {CCOIL/2}
.ends COTO9012_FUNCTIONAL
